    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The casual eco-simulation game <strong>Desktop Vivarium</strong> turns your desktop into a live backdrop, so you can tend your ecosystem while you work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Real-Time Dynamic Desktop</strong><br>Launch the game and your desktop instantly becomes an interactive 3D ecosphere. Watch your fish grow and your plants flourish\u2014bringing a touch of tranquility to your work or study breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Sandbox Terrain Editing</strong><br>Inspired by Minecraft\u2019s block system, you can craft a one-of-a-kind underwater landscape at any time using a variety of materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Open-World Foraging Expeditions</strong><br>Travel the globe to collect rare flora, fauna, and decorative elements to enrich your ecosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Multiple Ecosphere Sizes</strong><br>Whether your screen is wide or narrow, landscape or portrait, there\u2019s a perfectly fitting ecosphere to match your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Multiple Tanks</strong><br>One ecosphere isn\u2019t enough? Run two\u2014or three\u2014or more, and turn all your monitors into cradles of life!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The casual eco-simulation game <strong>Desktop Vivarium</strong> turns your desktop into a live backdrop, so you can tend your ecosystem while you work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Real-Time Dynamic Desktop</strong><br>Launch the game and your desktop instantly becomes an interactive 3D ecosphere. Watch your fish grow and your plants flourish\u2014bringing a touch of tranquility to your work or study breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Sandbox Terrain Editing</strong><br>Inspired by Minecraft\u2019s block system, you can craft a one-of-a-kind underwater landscape at any time using a variety of materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Open-World Foraging Expeditions</strong><br>Travel the globe to collect rare flora, fauna, and decorative elements to enrich your ecosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Multiple Ecosphere Sizes</strong><br>Whether your screen is wide or narrow, landscape or portrait, there\u2019s a perfectly fitting ecosphere to match your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Multiple Tanks</strong><br>One ecosphere isn\u2019t enough? Run two\u2014or three\u2014or more, and turn all your monitors into cradles of life!</p>",
    "short_description": "Your computer desktop will no longer be just a static background, but a living, breathing ecosphere. You\u2019ll watch plants and animals thrive as fish swim freely across your screen. In your downtime, you can feed the creatures, clean up their waste.",
